      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "An exciting new tale set in the world of Philip Pullman's His Dark Materials saga. This collectible hardcover volume includes a short story by Mr. Pullman, plus a fold-out map of Oxford and various \"souvenirs\" from the past. The book is illustrated throughout with woodcut illustrations by John Lawrence.From the Hardcover edition."
